agraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Diverse Game Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStory Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Lee Brothers to challenge the Shadow Warriors and rescue Marian!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDuel Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive nostalgic team battles in 1-on-1 matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSurvival Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out with up to 4 players until only one remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the legendary dodgeball battle with your own hands, right now!</p>","developers":["I.T.L"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1053540/824e135d9a79566b2c1453c8fac78c6c82fd609a/header.jpg?t=1761204120","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1053540/1536509122/4e88d27063401749ee4fe2818d6f1f7786166e0b/1759907838/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761011666","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1053540/1536509122/4e88d27063401749ee4fe2818d6f1f7786166e0b/1759907838/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761011666","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1053540/1536509122/4e88d27063401749ee4fe2818d6f1f7786166e0b/1759907838/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761011666","id":257214131,"name":"Introduction Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214131/2d1a21c761e0e28780387e1db064f76f088ce358/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761011666"}],"name":"Double Dragon Dodgeball","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1300X<br></li><li